  - Start a new row if there is no space left.
  - This approach may be time-consuming for long rows.

- **Optimized Approach:**
  - Concatenate all words in the sentence into a single string.
  - Calculate how many times this concatenated string can fit in a single row.
  - Use simple math to determine the number of sentences that can fit on a single line.
  - Efficiently compute where to start a new line based on remaining space.

